==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 5.33~8 seconds<sup>160f~240f</sup>.
*2 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Bearkini]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bearkini is outranged by [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], simply stack them on the One Horn to win.

